Option: redirects-B
Name: Old farm addresses: 13 small "this page has moved" pages
Does: Adds 13 folders (about/, contact/, faq/, food/ ...), each with an index.html that jumps to the matching page or section, lets tools/make_deploy_folder.py upload them, and lets tools/launch_check.py see that such a page forwards (it counts only real redirects otherwise). For hosts that ignore _redirects. Not a true 301: Google may take longer to move over.
Answers: d30 A (old addresses), d05 (any host; the only choice on GitHub Pages)
Group: redirects
Conflicts: redirects-A
Requires: tools/launch_check.py and tools/make_deploy_folder.py in the site (it edits both)
Host: any
Order: 30
After: nothing to rebuild; upload again (python3 tools/make_deploy_folder.py includes the folders)
Strings: none (the pages are outside the translation system)

